## 10. Axios 网络请求

```tsx
import axios from 'axios';

const api = axios.create({ baseURL: 'https://api.example.com', timeout: 10000 });

// 请求/响应拦截器（高阶）
api.interceptors.request.use((cfg) => {
  cfg.headers.Authorization = `Bearer ${getToken()}`;
